{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/703900-2ed-majesty","id":703900,"title":"[2ed] Majesty","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-16T16:07:44-07:00","id":703900,"title":"[2ed] Majesty","content":"What is the difference between the second and third power of Majesty?<br /> I mean, the second one inflicts the charmed condition, the third one, in the description seems to me that have the same effect of the charmed condition. Same thing for the part about entheralled condition.<br /> What am I missing. Can you clarify me the effect of these two powers (better explain also the fourth one)? <br /> Thank you all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-16T16:41:54-07:00","id":703968,"title":"","content":"Green Eyes basically allows the Kindred using it to change the emotional states of anyone affected by Confidant or Loyalty. So if you have a room full of people you have charmed or enthralled, you can make them happy, sad, whatever you wish. It also allows you to basically &quot;shift&quot; how conditions affect victims. A charmed mortal under the effect of Green Eyes basically behaves like someone who was enthralled. An enthralled mortal under the effect of Green Eyes has one limit: they won't kill themselves. Otherwise no action they take, including taking damage or what would normally be a breaking point, will cause the enthralled condition to resolve. It basically guarantees that the enthralled condition will last the maximum amount of time, and then the mortal suffers all of the consequences.<br /> <br /> \u200bLoyalty just reinforces the charmed condition inflicted by Confidant and makes the mortal suffer the enthralled condition.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1257,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","user":"Kerensky","date":".  Clarified a sentence. 10-16-2015, 08:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-16T17:09:43-07:00","id":703998,"title":"","content":"Ok now I think to understood <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Thank you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-16T17:17:24-07:00","id":704024,"title":"","content":"No problem. Glad to be of service.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T00:38:50-07:00","id":934943,"title":"","content":"<br /> A Pick up routine of a Daeva with presence 4, striking looks (+2) and majesty 3, who is looking for a new girlfriend:<br /> <br /> Let\u00b4s assume he would approach a very good looking woman he doesn\u00b4t know yet. He instantly uses &quot;Awe&quot;, &quot;Confident&quot; and &quot;The Green Eyes&quot; on her to make her feel extremely in love with him and overwhelmed by lustful sexual desire. He approaches her directly, looks deep into her eyes and unleashes his seductive beast by saying &quot;Please, excuse my intrusion, but I am overwhelmed by your beauty and I have the strong impression that we are made for each other.\u201d.<br /> Then he would make a seduction roll(e.g. presence+persuation or empathy) with an exceptional success, while continuing with the words: <br /> \u201cMy heart tells me that it is our destiny to become a loving couple with a very fulfilling sex life\u2026 <br /> Your eyes show me that your heart is telling you the same. \u2026 I am going to kiss you now \u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> After kissing her for a while: <br /> \u201cLet\u00b4s speed this up: \u2026 I would suggest to go to a hotel room, to fuck extensively and to make plans for our future. What do you think?\u201d<br /> <br /> What do you think about this approach? <br /> How could she react? <br /> <br /> <br /> Which impression would you give him for the social interactions, when \u201cthe Green Eyes\u201d wear off and he would continue to seduce her into a longterm relationship? &quot;Excellent&quot;? &quot;Perfect&quot;?<br /> <br /> Which chances would you give him without the use of blood bonds?<br /> <br /> Share your thoughts and ideas? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11546-christoph","name":"Christoph+","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T03:31:04-07:00","id":934980,"title":"","content":"After succeding to charmed her and using reflexively green eyes you don't really need to roll for the most part of the stuff you ask her...unless she is REALLY in love with his husband and would hit a breaking point being unfaithful with him. All the rest is automatic.<br /> With green eyes linked to Loyality (entheralled condition) she doesn't even hit the breaking point. She do whatever you want. Stop. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T07:19:57-07:00","id":935044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Christoph+</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/703900-2ed-majesty?p=934943#post934943\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"