n style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T07:07:18-07:00","id":937063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lepaca</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/703900-2ed-majesty?p=935670#post935670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not like I am an ambassador for all LGBT people but I took 0 offense in your scenario. On the contrary, I think conflicting sexual orientation served as a good way to illustrate one of the issue with Majesty induced affection.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> In my humble opinion, this is absolutely happening each and every day and therefore a realistic scenario. Of course certain circumstances greatly influence the chances of success (without supernatural assistance); e.g. swinger club vs. born-again bible study.<br /> However, if you are the storyteller you are obviously at liberty to determine that a given NPC has no interest in hooking up like that. I just think that it is better not to rule this out completely.</div> </div> </div> </div>I suppose it depends on how good the rapport is before you go ahead and make a crude request like that. Especially when you're taking a girl back to a hotel room, not their place or your place - a cheap, dingy hotel room. And, in the morning, you're not present - you'd be that guy who has to make a runner before the sun is even up. It would require a pretty liberal person to be okay with that the next morning IMO. But, thinking on it and in my experience, if you're meeting someone for the first time and sleeping together on the same night, that's damn rare to begin with. It's only happened once for me in my whole life, and I found out later that the girl was in a really bad place mentally (much better now, though) - but this was back to my place, not a hotel room - and she was homeless at the time. She definitely regrets that period of her life, too. Hell, even I regret it, especially now that we're friends, and it's absolutely turned me off having sex without getting to know someone first. In any case, I agree with you that 'certain circumstances greatly influences the chances of success', and I can certainly see that the scenario shouldn't be ruled out completely - but there's a lot of 'unwanted drama' that can be extrapolated from such a simple scenario IMO.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1592-jack","user":"Jack","date":". 07-25-2016, 10:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1592-jack","name":"Jack","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1592_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T13:21:46-07:00","id":937245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div cl